# corpus/successor-fields
profile own
scope.begin original_scope
new a A
new original O item=a
bind original_bind original
scope.begin copy_scope
get inherited original item
new copy S item=inherited
succ copy
use copy
scope.end copy_scope
check S
use original
scope.end original_scope
check SOA
reset.log
scope.begin original_scope2
new a2 A
new original2 O item=a2
bind original_bind2 original2
scope.begin replace_scope
new b B
new replaced S item=b
succ replaced
use replaced
scope.end replace_scope
check SB
use original2
scope.end original_scope2
check SBOA
